<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-UKIO SEVEN MONTH NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-UKIO SEVEN MONTH NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First seven months</p>
<p>				(million litas unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 1.333  vs 964,000 litas</p>
<p>    Assets			     188    vs 197</p>
<p>    Loan portfolio		   153    vs 147</p>
<p>    Deposits and LC		  141    vs 145</p>
<p>    Individual deposits	    52.9   vs 42.2</p>
<p>    Special provisions	     41.5   vs 43</p>
<p>Notes - All the figures except net profit are compared to</p>
<p>the beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
